            "notes": "# .\u00b7:*\u00a8\u00a8* \u2248\u2606Round 3\u2606\u2248 *\u00a8\u00a8*:\u00b7.\n\nFor Round 3, we start by selecting  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4)  as our new power, then sell all our uncommon items and purchase  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)  to further enhance our healing. If you can afford to, try to keep either  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  for a slight healing boost or  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)  for increased healing speed.\n\nWe choose  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4)  because it synergizes with an item in Round 4.",
