            "notes": "# .\u00b7:*\u00a8\u00a8* \u2248\u2606Round 4\u2606\u2248 *\u00a8\u00a8*:\u00b7.\n\nIn Round 4, we buy  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  to become the flying rat.\n\n[Angelic] works hand in hand with  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) , giving us up to 15% extra weapon power on top of the 35% we already have\u2014provided we're constantly jumping between allies. It also synergizes with  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) , as we use **Guardian Angel** to move between teammates.\n\nIf you can afford it, try adding  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)  for extra healing and movement speed, or  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)  for an additional 5% healing boost and 10% attack speed after healing an ally.",
